LITERAL_DA10_2477_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_DA10_2477_CHOICE_4';
<sup>5</sup>/<sub>11</sub> = 0.4545 = 45%
LITERAL_DA10_2477_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_DA10_2477_CHOICE_5';
