complete interference, 100%
LITERAL_DA10_2477_CHOICE_9
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_DA10_2477_CORRECT_1';
<sup>6</sup>/<sub>11</sub> = 0.5455 = 55%
LITERAL_DA10_2477_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6, $choice_7, $choice_8, $choice_9);
